  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nThe value of (12+3 frac{2)/(3) div[1 (3)/(4) divleft{5 (1)/(4) times(3 (3)/(5) div 4 (1)/(2))right}]}{1 (1)/(3) times 5 (1)/(5)} is:\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nEvaluate the expression step by step.\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nStart from the innermost expression: (3 (3)/(5) div 4 (1)/(2))\n\n⇒ (18)/(5) div (9)/(2)\n\n⇒ (18)/(5) times (2)/(9)\n\n⇒ (36)/(45)\n\n⇒ (4)/(5)\n\nNext, evaluate: (5 (1)/(4) times (4)/(5))\n\n⇒ (21)/(4) times (4)/(5)\n\n⇒ (84)/(20)\n\n⇒ (21)/(5)\n\nThen, evaluate: (1 (3)/(4) div (21)/(5))\n\n⇒ (7)/(4) div (21)/(5)\n\n⇒ (7)/(4) times (5)/(21)\n\n⇒ (35)/(84)\n\n⇒ (5)/(12)\n\nNext, evaluate: (3 (2)/(3) div (5)/(12))\n\n⇒ (11)/(3) div (5)/(12)\n\n⇒ (11)/(3) times (12)/(5)\n\n⇒ (132)/(15)\n\n⇒ (44)/(5)\n\nNext, evaluate: (12 + (44)/(5))\n\n⇒ (60)/(5) + (44)/(5)\n\n⇒ (104)/(5)\n\nFinally, evaluate the denominator: (1 (1)/(3) times 5 (1)/(5))\n\n⇒ (4)/(3) times (26)/(5)\n\n⇒ (104)/(15)\n\nNow, evaluate the entire expression: (frac{104)/(5)}{(104)/(15)}\n\n⇒ (104)/(5) times (15)/(104)\n\n⇒ 3\n\n**∴ The value is 3.**",
